I close my laptop.
There is quiet in my room.
I am a little sad.
But I am also happy.
I go outside.
Today is Sunday.
The street is very quiet.
I walk slowly.
There is a dog on the street.
Its color is black.
I remember Lola.
My brother Diego and my sister Sofia.
Their voices are in my mind.
A man is standing there.
Who is he?
He is the newspaper vendor.
He looks at me and smiles.
I smile too.
Mumbai is my home now.
